            f'Expected a cirq.PAULI_GATE_LIKE (any of cirq.I cirq.X, cirq.Y, '
            f'cirq.Z, "I", "X", "Y", "Z", "i", "x", "y", "z", 0, 1, 2, 3) but '
            f'got {repr(val)}.'
